- **Accessory & Service**: anomaly-month return rates are at or below their 24-month averages (no return-rate spike), and sales revert below the 24-month mean in the following 1–3 months — consistent with a one-off demand pulse (e.g., promo/event) rather than sustained channel stuffing.
